'''Battle God Odin''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was exclusive to the VIP [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]], only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 911
|rarity = UR
|version = PC
|name1 = Battle God Odin
|name2 = Odin End
|image1 = 10911 1.png
|image2 = 10911 2.png
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Odin End''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Much like the other units in [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties]], Battle God Odin is incredible. He has about the same range as Bahamut Cat, only with even more DPS and a knockback ability to keep opponents far away. Since he doesn't rely on a damage-increasing ability like [[Massive Damage]], he can still be used against [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies, it's just more risky since he can't knock them away, nor tank their attacks as well. In terms of damage, he is outclassed by [[Shining Amaterasu (Uber Rare Cat)|Shining Amaterasu]], though that says more about how incredible she is rather than how bad Odin is.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

